1f9aac",2.83],[-1,"Sure.","Žinoma.",1],[0,"Grab your board. Let's go!","Imkite lentą. Eime!","b386fd0c20ec",2.19],[0,"Hi! Here to rent or take a lesson?","Sveiki! Norite ką nors išsinuomoti ar pasimokyti čiuožti banglente?","748b557963c8",3.29],[-1,"I'd like to rent a paddleboard.","Norėčiau išsinuomoti irklentę.",1],[0,"The paddleboard costs twenty-five dollars per hour.","Irklentė kainuoja 25 $ už valandą.","1622d274d775",3.85],[0,"For how many hours?","Kelioms valandoms?","11b12fe99c9f",1.6],[-1,"For two hours.","Dviem valandoms.",1],[0,"Please leave an ID or a deposit of fifty dollars.","Prašau palikti asmens dokumentą arba 50 $ užstatą.","bdff00880502",4.44],[-1,"Here's my passport.","Štai mano pasas.",1],[0,"Thanks. I'll return it when you come back.","Ačiū. Kai sugrįšite, dokumentą atgausite.","4c288a79b3ff",2.46],[0,"For two hours, that's fifty dollars.","Už dvi valandas – 50 $.","02ebe61d4c12",3.74],[0,"Cash or card?","Grynaisiais ar kortele?","055ba2e6b832",1.25],[-1,"Where's an ATM?","Kur rasti bankomatą?",1],[0,"The ATM is beside Harbor Bank on Main Street.","Bankomatas yra prie „Harbor Bank“, Main gatvėje.","3311cb119600",4.37],[0,"How would you like to pay?","Kaip norėtumėte mokėti?","c1746658849f",1.38],[-1,"By card.","Kortele.",1],[0,"It went through.","Mokėjimas pavyko.","36f5b4ddf6f4",1.22],[0,"Here's the paddleboard, a paddle, and a life jacket.","Štai irklentė, irklas ir gelbėjimosi liemenė.","856a035579d0",4.63],[0,"Have fun! Stay inside the buoys.","Smagaus laiko! Laikykitės plūdurais pažymėtoje zonoje.","3309c7c56578",2.78],[0,"Before you go, want to try a wave? It's free.","Prieš išeidami gal norite pagauti vieną bangą? Už ją mokėti nereikės.","f0bc3a0da2ce",3.65],[-1,"Yes, let's go!","Taip, eime!",1],[0,"Let's go! I'll lend you a soft board.","Eime! Paskolinsiu Jums minkštą lentą.","53fc9a845a80",2.67],[-1,"I want to learn to surf.","Noriu išmokti čiuožti banglente.",1],[0,"Have you ever surfed?","Ar kada nors čiuožėte banglente?","6beb66546f31",1.56],[-1,"No, never.","Ne, niekada.",1],[0,"We can start with small waves.","Galime pradėti nuo mažų bangų.","80b338449f17",2.54],[0,"A one-hour beginner lesson is sixty dollars. Soft board and surf shirt included.","Vienos valandos pamoka pradedantiesiems kainuoja 60 $. Minkšta banglentė ir marškinėliai įskaičiuoti.","58d75c32b82c",6.89],[0,"Want to book it?","Norite užsisakyti pamoką?","86493fedfc3c",1.02],[-1,"Maybe another day.","Gal kitą dieną.",1],[0,"No problem.","Jokių bėdų.","ca39956791c5",1.33],[0,"The boards are by the water. Come back anytime.","Lentos prie vandens. Sugrįžkite, kada norėsite.","ea2ad1aa470b",3.11],[0,"Would you like to rent something?","Gal norėtumėte ką nors išsinuomoti?","bcb6374f8b2d",1.75],[-1,"No, I'm good, thanks.","Ne, man nereikia, ačiū.",1],[0,"Take care!","Iki pasimatymo!","199807ec62a8",0.66],[-1,"Can I rent a double kayak?","Ar galiu išsinuomoti dvivietę baidarę?",1],[0,"The double kayak costs thirty-five dollars per hour.","Dvivietė baidarė kainuoja 35 $ už valandą.","ca72205d0e72",3.65],[0,"How long do you need it?","Kuriam laikui norite išsinuomoti?","3bef13f71f48",1.52],[0,"Can you leave an ID? I'll give it back.","Ar galite palikti asmens dokumentą? Kai grįšite, jį atgausite.","6adaf8193e7b",2.93],[-1,"I'll leave the deposit.","Paliksiu užstatą.",1],[0,"Okay. I'll add the deposit.","Gerai. Užstatą pridėsiu prie nuomos kainos.","fbad57d33583",2.14],[0,"For two hours, that's seventy dollars.","Už dvi valandas – 70 $.","577f1add6cde",3.54],[0,"With the deposit, it's one hundred twenty dollars total.","Su užstatu iš viso – 120 $.","e4e6a09784b3",4.07],[-1,"Here you go.","Prašom.",1],[0,"Thanks!","Ačiū!","797557bd240d",1.21],[0,"Here's your kayak, two paddles, and two life jackets.","Štai jūsų baidarė, du irklai ir dvi gelbėjimosi liemenės.","ceab55a68bb1",4.81],[0,"Enjoy the water! Stay in the marked area.","Smagaus laiko vandenyje! Likite pažymėtoje zonoje.","7aa89297aa5e",3.6],[-1,"No, thanks.","Ne, ačiū.",1],[0,"No problem.","Nieko tokio.","ca39956791c5",1.33],[-1,"Hi! How are you?","Sveiki! Kaip sekasi?",1],[0,"I'm good, thanks! And you?","Gerai, ačiū! O Jums?","2c7a277c9518",2.3],[-1,"Great, thanks for asking!","Puikiai, ačiū, kad klausiate!",1],[0,"Glad to hear it!","Smagu girdėti!","a5965fe29b03",1.53],[-1,"Thank you very much!","Labai ačiū!",1],[0,"My pleasure!","Mielai!","6791294f77a2",0.9],[-1,"When's the best time to go?","Kada geriausia važiuoti?",1],[0,"I usually go in late summer.","Paprastai ten važiuoju vasaros pabaigoje.","f7db35cb15fc",2.31],[0,"Sure, another day.","Žinoma, gal kitą dieną.","9ec7f023f338",1.76],[-1,"Thanks for your help!","Ačiū už pagalbą!",1],[0,"Anytime!","Visada prašom!","cc9b4355e7eb",1.28],[-1,"I'll take a surfboard.","Imsiu banglentę.",1],[0,"The surfboard costs twenty dollars per hour.","Banglentė kainuoja 20 $ už valandą.","d780b7e163b6",3.27],[0,"For two hours, that's forty dollars.","Už dvi valandas – 40 $.","f2bce7d38a0d",3.73],[0,"With the deposit, it's ninety dollars total.","Su užstatu iš viso – 90 $.","b7af07d1ad5e",3.39],[0,"Here's your board and leash.","Štai Jūsų banglentė su saitu.","cdcdc14cd4af",2.36],[-1,"Have a nice day!","Geros dienos!",1],[0,"See you in the water!","Pasimatysime vandenyje!","3609a4874b25",1.18],[-1,"Can I rent a single kayak?","Ar galiu išsinuomoti vienvietę baidarę?",1],[0,"The single kayak costs twenty-five dollars per hour.","Vienvietė baidarė kainuoja 25 $ už valandą.","16dfe09f3e2b",4.05],[0,"The card reader has no signal. Cash only today.","Kortelių skaitytuvas negaudo ryšio. Šiandien galima mokėti tik grynaisiais.","6a24d5589765",3.28],[0,"Here's the single kayak, a paddle, and a life jacket.","Štai vienvietė baidarė, irklas ir gelbėjimosi liemenė.","73272fe601be",4.7],[-1,"That would be great, thanks.","Būtų puiku, ačiū.",1],[-1,"A double kayak for two hours, please.","Prašyčiau dvivietės baidarės dviem valandoms.",1],[-1,"I don't have my ID.","Neturiu su savimi asmens dokumento.",1],[0,"You can leave fifty dollars instead. You'll get it back.","Galite palikti 50 $ užstatą. Kai grąžinsite įrangą, jį atgausite.","c9e7188cc398",3.63],[0,"Will you leave the deposit?","Ar paliksite užstatą?","64f7d91f25a9",1.82],[-1,"Sure, thanks!","Žinoma, ačiū!",1],[-1,"Do you take cards?","Ar galima mokėti kortele?",1],[0,"Yes, we take cards.","Taip, galite mokėti kortele.","4f7ff1d8f82d",1.27],[-1,"Great, by card then.","Puiku, tada mokėsiu kortele.",1],[-1,"Yes, please.","Taip, prašau.",1],[-1,"How are the waves?","Kokios šiandien bangos?",1],[0,"Waves are about two feet. Light wind, low tide.","Bangos maždaug dviejų pėdų. Vėjas silpnas, dabar atoslūgis.","2ca62386f80f",4.66],[-1,"I'll take a snorkel kit.","Imsiu paviršinio nardymo rinkinį.",1],[0,"The snorkel kit costs fifteen dollars per hour.","Paviršinio nardymo rinkinys kainuoja 15 $ už valandą.","9c90ae6179f8",3.59],[0,"For two hours, that's thirty dollars.","Už dvi valandas – 30 $.","6e924b8bfa30",3.65],[0,"With the deposit, it's eighty dollars total.","Su užstatu iš viso – 80 $.","95205182fda1",3.42],[0,"Here's your mask, snorkel, and fins.","Štai Jūsų kaukė, kvėpavimo vamzdelis ir plaukmenys.","2a3e1b37fc09",3.35],[-1,"I'd like a surf lesson.","Norėčiau banglenčių pamokos.",1],[-1,"I've surfed a couple of times.","Porą kartų čiuožiau banglente.",1],[0,"Great! We can go over the basics.","Puiku! Galime pakartoti pagrindus.","c72df0db4d61",2.64],[0,"Of course.","Žinoma.","0fb5dfa7e1a9",1],[-1,"Pretty good, thanks!","Visai gerai, ačiū!",1],[0,"You're welcome!","Prašom!","e4ba8a51b604",1.15],[0,"I go there when the waves are bigger.","Ten važiuoju, kai bangos didesnės.","9b84560376c9",1.94],[0,"No problem!","Nėra už ką!","bf398416b6a2",1.06],[-1,"Cash, please.","Mokėsiu grynaisiais.",1],[-1,"What if I come back late?","O jei vėluosiu grąžinti įrangą?",1],[0,"Ten minutes is fine. After that, it's ten dollars for the extra half hour.","Galite vėluoti dešimt minučių. Vėliau už papildomą pusvalandį mokėsite 10 $.","ef9cc0